The three names link to `/workbench`, `/garden` and `/feed`. You hadn't chosen a feed name yet, so I used "the journal by the window" (my lean); it's a one-word edit in `src/pages/index.astro` if you prefer another. The list uses the same grey as your intro text, and the links get your usual orange colour and hover underline.

